Riftway CEF patch 0008: CefRequestContext::ResolveProxy and ResolveSystemProxy.

Adds what Electron's session.resolveProxy and app.resolveProxy do through
ResolveProxyHelper (shell/browser/net/resolve_proxy_helper.cc):
NetworkContext::LookUpProxyForURL with an empty NetworkAnonymizationKey, and
the answer as net::ProxyInfo::ToPacString, empty when the lookup fails.
ResolveProxy asks the context's profile network context; the static
ResolveSystemProxy (cef_request_context_resolve_system_proxy) asks the system
network context, which follows Local State's "proxy" preference, as app's.
Setting proxies needs no patch: the "proxy" preference of a request context or
of the global preference manager. The client callback is
CefResolveProxyCallback. API at CEF_NEXT (999998): API version 15400 and its
hash are unchanged.

Resolves: Riftway docs/DRIFT.md A35 (resolveProxy) and E8's resolveProxy.
Base: CEF a03e714 (branch 8037, CEF 154) with 0001-0007. Applies in chromium/src/cef.

